{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>您是否厭倦了手機上那些功能臃腫、廣告繁多的電子書閱讀器？渴望一個純粹、高效的數位閱讀空間嗎？《EPUB 閱讀器 Pro》今天限時免費中，正是為追求極致閱讀體驗的您而生，它能讓您擺脫干擾，沉浸在文字的海洋裡，享受不受打擾的閱讀時光。</p>\n\n<h2>多種個人化設定，打造專屬閱讀空間</h2>\n<p>它完整支援 EPUB 2 與 EPUB 3 格式，讓您能順暢閱讀各種電子書，並提供多種主題、四種閱讀模式及字體調整功能，輕鬆打造最符合個人習慣的舒適閱讀環境。此外，App 內建的整齊書架管理、Wi-Fi 上傳書籍以及 AirDrop 檔案分享，讓您的數位藏書井然有序，存取分享都便捷高效，真正實現純粹的閱讀體驗。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1284x2778bb-158-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1284x2778bb-159-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1284x2778bb-160-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2064x2752bb-31-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2064x2752bb-32-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2064x2752bb-33-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：EPUB 閱讀器 Pro</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-30T16:09:49.494940+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":337,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}